# Lifecraft Engine: "As this Vehicle enters, choose a creature type. ... Each creature you control of the chosen type other
# than this Vehicle gets +1/+1." Bot1 casts it with three Moxen choosing Thopter. Bot1's Ornithopter (a 0/2 Thopter) is a
# 1/3; Bot1's Memnite (a Construct) stays 1/1; Bot2's own Ornithopter, cast on turn 2, is not Bot1's creature and stays 0/2.
# The Engine is not a creature while uncrewed, so it gets no bonus itself and has no creature type added.

